Google | Open Google | xdg-open "https://google.com"
ChatGPT | Open ChatGPT | xdg-open "https://chatgpt.com"
Restart UI | Reload shell | quickshell -c ii & quickshell -p ~/.config/skwd
Update System | Arch update | yay -Syu
Vesktop | Open Discord | vesktop
Lockscreen | Change lockscreen theme | ~/.config/qylock/change_theme.sh
Cursor | Change system cursor theme | ~/.local/bin/cursor-picker
